WEBVTT

00:14.625 --> 00:16.458
Come at me.

00:17.166 --> 00:18.708
You piece of shit.

00:19.375 --> 00:22.416
You really want me to kill you, huh?

00:23.291 --> 00:25.375
I can tell he's livid with rage.

00:27.125 --> 00:28.208
This is…

00:37.291 --> 00:41.291
Rule one, don't lose your cool.

00:42.541 --> 00:46.291
The easiest opponent to defeat
is one who's lost their cool.

00:46.375 --> 00:49.833
If you can't keep yourself under control,

00:49.916 --> 00:55.375
you'll just be swinging around
your emotions, not your fists.

00:55.875 --> 00:59.625
In other words, if you can get
your opponent to lose their cool,

01:00.166 --> 01:03.208
then you gain that much of an advantage.

01:11.208 --> 01:12.250
I dodged it.

01:12.958 --> 01:16.625
Is that rooster guy the real deal,
and not a sham?

01:16.708 --> 01:18.708
Can he really make me stronger?

01:18.791 --> 01:20.416
Quit dodging!

01:20.500 --> 01:21.583
Another punch!

01:21.666 --> 01:23.958
If I'm gonna get hit, I might as well…

01:24.041 --> 01:26.166
A punch is at its most powerful

01:26.250 --> 01:28.541
when the arm is fully extended.

01:28.625 --> 01:31.875
If you can take the hit before
your opponent fully extends his arm…

01:34.166 --> 01:36.166
it won't hurt!

01:36.250 --> 01:40.166
We'll call it
the "how to get hit without pain" method.

01:40.250 --> 01:41.458
He's right.

01:41.958 --> 01:44.083
It doesn't… hurt.

01:44.166 --> 01:46.250
What the hell is he doing?

01:47.625 --> 01:49.375
That rooster guy was right.

01:50.000 --> 01:52.375
Just who on Earth is he?

01:56.375 --> 01:58.666
I can do this. I can win!

02:04.208 --> 02:05.125
Wait…

02:05.708 --> 02:07.208
I forgot what comes after this.

02:08.625 --> 02:11.791
Hold on, what am I supposed to do next?

02:13.875 --> 02:16.000
Wait! You have to teach me--

02:19.500 --> 02:20.333
Shimura…

02:24.041 --> 02:26.250
You've got some nerve.

02:26.333 --> 02:27.833
Crap.

02:27.916 --> 02:30.166
I should've watched the next video.

02:32.333 --> 02:33.958
-You're fucking dead.
-Enough!

02:38.208 --> 02:40.125
I'm streaming this now.

02:42.166 --> 02:44.375
Do you plan to keep acting like fools?

02:49.916 --> 02:50.958
You bastards…

02:51.875 --> 02:53.041
This isn't over.

03:07.458 --> 03:09.375
When did you start streaming?

03:10.958 --> 03:12.041
I never did.

03:12.125 --> 03:14.000
-What?
-It was a bluff.

03:20.541 --> 03:23.250
Thank you for saving me.

03:24.416 --> 03:25.583
No need to thank me.

03:25.666 --> 03:26.666
What's your name?

03:28.250 --> 03:30.083
Aki Yashio. I'm a first-year.

03:31.000 --> 03:32.125
You're younger?

03:32.208 --> 03:34.916
I have lived abroad for long.

03:35.416 --> 03:37.375
My Japanese is not good.

03:37.458 --> 03:39.541
Oh, that's why you talk like that.

03:39.625 --> 03:41.875
Who cares? Don't be so petty.

03:43.041 --> 03:44.333
So you're Aki.

03:44.833 --> 03:46.125
That's a nice name.

03:48.166 --> 03:50.208
If only you'd lasted a little longer.

03:50.291 --> 03:53.000
The donations were
finally starting to come in.

03:53.500 --> 03:55.291
How much did we make?

03:57.666 --> 03:59.166
25,000 yen.

04:00.333 --> 04:01.875
That's it?

04:02.750 --> 04:05.041
Any longer would've been a waste of time.

04:05.541 --> 04:07.833
Besides, I assume you had no moves left.

04:08.375 --> 04:11.000
He would have wrecked you,
ending the fight.

04:11.666 --> 04:12.791
That's true.

04:12.875 --> 04:14.125
Tell me.

04:14.666 --> 04:17.250
Who edits the videos
after streams are over?

04:18.625 --> 04:19.583
I do.

04:20.500 --> 04:22.000
Wait, you like my edits?

04:22.083 --> 04:23.000
It's mediocre.

04:23.083 --> 04:24.250
What?

04:24.333 --> 04:26.541
You'll never get more viewers with that.

04:26.625 --> 04:30.000
Fewer viewers mean fewer donations.

04:30.583 --> 04:33.625
But what are we supposed to do?

04:36.125 --> 04:37.875
I happen to be good at editing.

04:38.791 --> 04:39.625
-Huh?
-What?

04:44.500 --> 04:46.333
I want to join your team.

04:50.958 --> 04:51.916
-Hey.
-Hmm?

04:52.000 --> 04:53.416
Are you sure about this?

04:53.500 --> 04:55.541
We need to add a girl's perspective.

04:55.625 --> 04:58.166
Don't worry,
I'll bring in more subscribers.

04:58.250 --> 05:01.208
That's right.
Aki's gonna help grow our channel.

05:01.291 --> 05:03.875
Plus, we really need to pick
a channel name already.

05:04.375 --> 05:06.500
It's still "Kanegon TV" now.

05:06.583 --> 05:11.041
Aki'll come up with something good,
since girls have better taste.

05:11.541 --> 05:13.750
I already know what to name it.

05:14.333 --> 05:15.250
Wait, for real?

05:17.625 --> 05:19.625
Yes. "Viral Hit."

05:20.625 --> 05:23.125
-What?
-"Viral Hit"?

05:24.833 --> 05:26.958
HOW_TO_FIGHT

05:27.041 --> 05:28.708
Aki, that's a little…

05:28.791 --> 05:30.625
I'll quit if you don't approve.

05:31.208 --> 05:32.083
Hold on.

05:32.833 --> 05:36.041
It shows originality,
and I actually think it's great.

05:36.125 --> 05:37.333
Right, Shimura?

05:37.416 --> 05:38.833
-Yeah.
-It's decided then.

05:39.958 --> 05:43.875
Today's the special day
Viral Hit was formed!

05:43.958 --> 05:45.791
Things are gonna get busy.

05:45.875 --> 05:47.875
You won't have time to fry potatoes.

05:48.375 --> 05:49.208
Sure.

06:03.250 --> 06:04.583
Raise your legs high!

06:04.666 --> 06:06.375
Tighten your abs.

06:06.458 --> 06:08.333
Now exhale. One--

06:08.833 --> 06:10.083
I'm exhausted.

06:14.083 --> 06:17.291
Am I really gonna get stronger doing this?

06:20.000 --> 06:24.500
Wait, who sent me this video
in the first place?

06:25.000 --> 06:27.083
Shimura, your break's almost over.

06:27.166 --> 06:28.583
Asamiya.

06:29.083 --> 06:30.750
I didn't realize. Thanks.

06:32.083 --> 06:34.000
Do you hear something?

06:34.083 --> 06:35.666
-Moving on to…
-Huh?

06:37.833 --> 06:39.291
It's your imagination.

06:39.791 --> 06:40.708
Okay.

06:41.208 --> 06:44.041
The manager wants
to discuss your schedule.

06:44.125 --> 06:47.166
I had a hunch he would. Thanks.

06:54.500 --> 06:58.958
I can't remove you from a scheduled shift
just because you asked.

06:59.041 --> 07:01.083
Sorry for the sudden request.

07:01.166 --> 07:03.666
You're scheduled to work every day.

07:03.750 --> 07:04.666
Yeah…

07:08.375 --> 07:10.000
Maybe Jessica can?

07:10.083 --> 07:12.208
Or no, I guess she can't.

07:12.291 --> 07:13.666
-Excuse me.
-Yeah?

07:13.750 --> 07:18.458
What if the rest of us took turns
on the days Shimura can't come in?

07:19.541 --> 07:22.333
We could make a group chat on LINE
for the part-timers.

07:23.208 --> 07:24.750
Good idea.

07:24.833 --> 07:26.333
-Let's do it.
-Yeah?

07:26.416 --> 07:28.125
-Sure.
-Go ahead.

07:28.208 --> 07:29.041
KAHO ASAMIYA

07:29.125 --> 07:31.750
Dude, you're creepy.
All you did was connect on LINE.

07:31.833 --> 07:33.041
Whatever.

07:33.125 --> 07:36.500
This phone is now a bridge
that connects me and Asamiya.

07:39.333 --> 07:41.000
Thanks for cooperating.

07:41.083 --> 07:44.083
Even her sticker is adorable.

07:45.333 --> 07:48.375
Hey, aren't you that famous streamer?

07:48.458 --> 07:50.750
-Wait, you recognize me?
-Of course!

07:50.833 --> 07:52.250
It's really you.

07:52.333 --> 07:53.916
-I'm his producer.
-Okay.

07:54.000 --> 07:56.291
Ken, who are they?

07:57.958 --> 07:59.833
Whoa… No way!

07:59.916 --> 08:02.958
I can't believe it! We got super lucky.

08:03.041 --> 08:04.458
Let's talk over there.

08:04.541 --> 08:06.208
-Sure!
-Cool. Let's go.

08:06.291 --> 08:07.625
Can we take a selfie?

08:07.708 --> 08:08.708
Of course.

08:08.791 --> 08:10.458
-A handshake?
-Sure.

08:10.541 --> 08:12.666
-Thank you!
-You're good-looking.

08:12.750 --> 08:15.333
Now, jump.

08:15.416 --> 08:18.458
Go on, jump.

08:19.541 --> 08:22.083
See? You still have money on you.

08:22.166 --> 08:23.541
I knew it.

08:23.625 --> 08:24.916
I'm taking this.

08:25.416 --> 08:27.083
-It's covered in dust.
-Huh?

08:27.166 --> 08:29.791
They don't have any money.

08:29.875 --> 08:32.666
I thought you guys were loaded.

08:32.750 --> 08:34.166
This is so lame.

08:35.958 --> 08:37.875
We're taking this instead.

08:37.958 --> 08:39.291
My bridge to Asamiya!

08:39.375 --> 08:41.333
Shut the hell up.

08:41.416 --> 08:43.666
Don't get cocky with me, loser.

08:43.750 --> 08:46.000
Oh Ken, you're as dashing as ever.

08:46.083 --> 08:47.791
-Aren't I?
-I love you.

08:47.875 --> 08:48.875
-Wait…
-Me too.

08:48.958 --> 08:51.333
I'm starving. Let's eat something tasty.

08:51.416 --> 08:54.791
Kanegon, we've gotta call the police
and get my phone back!

08:54.875 --> 08:56.666
Call the police?

08:56.750 --> 08:58.041
No way.

08:58.625 --> 08:59.583
What?

08:59.666 --> 09:02.291
Can't you see the fans going wild?

09:02.875 --> 09:03.916
You were streaming?

09:04.000 --> 09:06.125
I started when
we got dragged into the alley.

09:07.916 --> 09:09.458
I can hear it.

09:09.541 --> 09:12.625
I can hear the jingle
as donations hit our account!

09:13.666 --> 09:16.416
But that means
I have to go get beat up again.

09:17.000 --> 09:17.916
You wanna quit then?

09:19.708 --> 09:22.333
Fine. We'll go talk to the police.

09:22.958 --> 09:24.000
The police?

09:29.208 --> 09:30.541
Hell no.

09:35.583 --> 09:39.125
Starting the Viral Hit live stream now!

09:39.208 --> 09:40.958
PROB GONNA MAKE A DONATION

09:41.041 --> 09:42.833
I'VE BEEN WAITING FOR THIS!

09:42.916 --> 09:44.583
THIS IS GONNA BE EPIC!

09:44.666 --> 09:46.166
I'M DONATING TOO!

09:53.333 --> 09:58.833
VIRAL HIT

09:58.916 --> 10:01.000
Huh? You want your phone back?

10:01.083 --> 10:02.291
Please give it back.

10:02.375 --> 10:05.291
Hey, they're filming us.

10:05.375 --> 10:08.041
Hell yeah. Now I'll be famous.

10:08.125 --> 10:09.291
-Yeah!
-Hey.

10:09.375 --> 10:11.083
Keep me off camera.

10:11.166 --> 10:12.583
I won't film you.

10:13.083 --> 10:14.750
So what did you want from me?

10:15.250 --> 10:16.291
Like I said,

10:17.041 --> 10:18.250
I want my phone back.

10:18.333 --> 10:19.666
If I say no?

10:20.416 --> 10:23.500
If you say no… there will be consequences.

10:26.875 --> 10:28.000
Are you serious?

10:28.083 --> 10:30.708
What are you waiting for?
Beat him up, Ken.

10:30.791 --> 10:32.083
Sure thing.

10:33.125 --> 10:34.875
Hey guys, check this out.

10:34.958 --> 10:38.416
I'm about to give him a beat down!

10:39.625 --> 10:40.458
Time to try

10:41.333 --> 10:43.125
the techniques from the video.

10:43.208 --> 10:46.833
First, identify your opponent's
dominant hand.

10:47.333 --> 10:49.500
If your opponent is an amateur,

10:49.583 --> 10:53.041
they'll most likely use
their dominant hand to strike.

10:53.125 --> 10:54.708
His dominant hand is…

10:54.791 --> 10:56.833
-My bridge connecting…
-Shut up.

10:57.333 --> 10:58.208
The right.

10:58.750 --> 11:01.166
If your opponent is right-handed,

11:01.250 --> 11:05.541
stand to their left so they can
swing their right hand easily.

11:05.625 --> 11:08.833
You're gonna make them
swing their right hand.

11:08.916 --> 11:10.500
You're funny.

11:10.583 --> 11:14.416
-I'll wipe you out!
-Not sure when to dodge the punch?

11:14.500 --> 11:16.250
It's simple.

11:16.333 --> 11:18.666
People who lack martial arts training

11:18.750 --> 11:22.166
tend to move their shoulders wide.

11:23.541 --> 11:24.583
Now!

11:28.666 --> 11:29.875
You little prick.

11:29.958 --> 11:31.000
Ken!

11:31.500 --> 11:32.458
Ken…

11:33.375 --> 11:34.666
You bastard!

11:38.125 --> 11:39.125
HE'S DANCING LOL

11:39.208 --> 11:40.500
CHICKEN DANCE LOL

11:41.708 --> 11:43.083
What's that weird-ass move?

11:44.166 --> 11:45.833
It's called "weaving" in boxing.

11:45.916 --> 11:47.916
LET'S GO SHIMURA! LMAO

11:49.375 --> 11:51.458
Well done.

11:51.541 --> 11:52.916
Damn it, stop moving!

11:53.000 --> 11:54.625
Go, Ken! Go!

11:55.125 --> 12:00.166
It's hard for an average person
to land a punch on a moving target.

12:02.250 --> 12:03.333
That worked, too.

12:03.833 --> 12:04.791
Aerobics?

12:04.875 --> 12:09.833
Aerobics will teach you rhythm
and how to carry your body.

12:10.583 --> 12:12.125
You bastard!

12:12.208 --> 12:13.291
-Don't move!
-Wait!

12:18.291 --> 12:19.958
You little shit.

12:20.583 --> 12:21.541
Wait!

12:25.666 --> 12:26.625
Outta my way!

12:29.208 --> 12:30.250
It

12:30.791 --> 12:31.708
didn't hurt.

12:33.708 --> 12:36.875
Fighting isn't
so intimidating anymore, is it?

12:36.958 --> 12:40.375
Now, let's enjoy!

12:41.333 --> 12:42.750
You twerp!

12:56.458 --> 12:57.333
Wait, what?

12:57.416 --> 12:58.791
-Move!
-Move?

12:58.875 --> 12:59.916
Outta my way!

13:00.000 --> 13:00.916
Ken?

13:01.000 --> 13:02.833
You're cornered now.

13:02.916 --> 13:05.416
Crap… I don't have space to move.

13:05.500 --> 13:07.875
You dumbass!

13:07.958 --> 13:10.000
"How to get hit without pain"!

13:12.541 --> 13:13.458
-Huh?
-Ken?

13:15.291 --> 13:18.458
Give me… my phone back.

13:22.833 --> 13:24.125
I WANNA LEARN THIS

13:24.208 --> 13:25.750
REVENGE OF THE UNDERDOG!

13:34.000 --> 13:35.000
Ken!

13:35.500 --> 13:37.791
DO YOU HAVE A PLATE IN YOUR FOREHEAD?

13:39.375 --> 13:40.750
HE'S TAKING ALL THE HITS

13:40.833 --> 13:42.333
CAN'T BEAT A REAL THUG

13:45.208 --> 13:47.833
Don't be so sure. Look at the thug's fist.

13:50.541 --> 13:51.708
Goddamn it!

13:52.750 --> 13:53.708
Ken, are you okay?

13:53.791 --> 13:55.541
Of course, no problem.

13:56.708 --> 13:57.750
-Ow.
-Are you okay?

13:57.833 --> 14:00.208
He doesn't realize it
because of the adrenaline,

14:00.291 --> 14:02.750
but his fist is banged up.

14:02.833 --> 14:03.666
Shit!

14:06.291 --> 14:07.666
What the hell's your deal?

14:09.166 --> 14:12.041
I'll let you off the hook for today.

14:12.125 --> 14:14.416
-Let's go.
-Party's over!

14:14.916 --> 14:15.916
Asamiya…

14:16.416 --> 14:18.083
Good job, Shimura!

14:18.583 --> 14:20.958
A word for the generous viewers
who made a donation.

14:21.750 --> 14:23.750
Please continue to support us.

14:23.833 --> 14:26.083
That's all from Viral Hit.

14:26.166 --> 14:29.416
Oh, also, keep the donations coming!

14:30.416 --> 14:33.166
Doesn't it hurt, getting hit that much?

14:33.250 --> 14:34.125
No.

14:34.625 --> 14:36.833
Actually, yeah, a little.

14:36.916 --> 14:38.041
SO IT DOES HURT LOL

14:38.125 --> 14:40.208
SHIMURA, HERO OF BULLIED KIDS!

14:40.291 --> 14:41.958
50,219 VIEWERS WATCHING NOW

14:43.750 --> 14:46.250
-Please subscribe!
-And please donate!

14:46.333 --> 14:48.333
Yeah, keep the donations coming!

14:48.416 --> 14:49.583
You were awesome!

14:49.666 --> 14:51.041
Thank you!

14:52.375 --> 14:54.208
-You were great!
-Thank you.

14:54.291 --> 14:55.875
Oh, okay.

14:55.958 --> 14:59.166
Please subscribe to our channel
and donate to…

15:15.208 --> 15:18.875
Currently, we have five videos
on our Viral Hit channel.

15:18.958 --> 15:22.500
We have more than
five million views in total.

15:22.583 --> 15:23.416
And…

15:25.250 --> 15:27.083
RECENT LIVE EARNINGS: 132,000 YEN

15:28.166 --> 15:30.875
We got our first payout.

15:30.958 --> 15:32.583
More than my part-time pay.

15:33.166 --> 15:35.958
Leave it to me, and it's an easy win.

15:37.625 --> 15:39.833
How should we split the money?

15:39.916 --> 15:41.291
I'll pass.

15:41.375 --> 15:42.291
You sure?

15:42.375 --> 15:43.583
Of course not!

15:43.666 --> 15:46.166
Aki, you don't have to worry about him.

15:46.750 --> 15:49.000
This is just a pastime for me.

15:49.083 --> 15:50.833
I humbly accept your kindness.

15:50.916 --> 15:52.125
Don't!

15:52.208 --> 15:56.041
I'll hold on to Aki's share
in the meantime.

15:56.125 --> 15:57.375
Whatever.

15:58.000 --> 15:58.833
Here's the plan.

15:59.916 --> 16:04.375
Since I did all the filming, directing,
editing, and planning up until now…

16:04.875 --> 16:06.041
How about I get 90,

16:07.000 --> 16:08.208
and you get 10?

16:08.291 --> 16:09.166
What?

16:10.375 --> 16:12.833
Let's keep up the good work.

16:20.750 --> 16:21.583
Fuck you.

16:21.666 --> 16:23.500
-What?
-Why is it 90 to 10?

16:23.583 --> 16:25.666
I'd rather be making french fries.

16:25.750 --> 16:27.083
Okay then.

16:27.583 --> 16:28.458
How about

16:29.000 --> 16:31.416
I take 60 percent and you take 40?

16:32.291 --> 16:34.208
Why don't you be the punchbag, Kanegon?

16:35.375 --> 16:36.375
Hold on.

16:36.916 --> 16:38.083
40 to 60.

16:38.583 --> 16:39.416
30 to 70.

16:40.541 --> 16:41.500
Dammit!

16:42.000 --> 16:43.208
20 to 80.

16:44.958 --> 16:46.750
10 to 90…

16:50.916 --> 16:53.541
Let's start our strategy meeting,

16:54.083 --> 16:55.833
Producer Kanegon.

17:00.208 --> 17:01.250
Don't touch me!

17:11.958 --> 17:12.791
TOO PRETTY!

17:12.875 --> 17:13.916
SHE'S EYE CANDY

17:14.000 --> 17:15.166
YUM YUM!

17:18.458 --> 17:19.916
IT'S HAMAKEN'S GIRL LOL

17:20.000 --> 17:21.750
GOOD TIME FOR 10,000 YEN?

17:21.833 --> 17:23.541
SUCH A PICK-ME GIRL

17:23.625 --> 17:25.750
FOLLOWERS: 21,000

17:32.500 --> 17:34.625
VIRAL HIT SUBSCRIBERS: 102,000

18:12.541 --> 18:15.041
I'll leave your change of clothes here.

18:16.083 --> 18:18.000
Did something good happen?

18:18.500 --> 18:19.583
Why do you ask?

18:20.208 --> 18:22.250
You just seem happy.

18:22.750 --> 18:24.625
Nothing in particular.

18:25.708 --> 18:30.125
Oh, before I forget.
Is there anything you wish you had?

18:30.750 --> 18:32.708
What is this all of a sudden?

18:34.916 --> 18:36.583
There's nothing I want.

18:37.875 --> 18:40.625
You should spend your money on yourself.

18:41.541 --> 18:45.333
It's your hard-earned money.

18:47.041 --> 18:49.375
I bought you a new top.

18:49.458 --> 18:51.583
It's darling.

18:51.666 --> 18:52.916
-How nice.
-You think?

18:54.083 --> 18:54.916
Thank you.

18:55.625 --> 18:56.458
Good!

18:57.125 --> 18:58.875
It looks great on you.

18:58.958 --> 18:59.791
-Really?
-Yes.

18:59.875 --> 19:01.416
I'm so glad.

19:10.166 --> 19:11.000
CASHMERE

19:11.083 --> 19:12.208
It's so expensive.

19:12.291 --> 19:14.250
It really costs this much?

19:19.625 --> 19:20.583
No way.

19:28.041 --> 19:29.833
How did it come to this?

19:30.333 --> 19:32.125
What am I supposed to do?

19:32.208 --> 19:33.500
Shimura.

19:36.500 --> 19:39.041
Here comes True Beauty.

19:42.708 --> 19:43.583
Hi.

19:43.666 --> 19:46.500
Sorry this was so last minute.
Did you wait?

19:46.583 --> 19:47.708
Not at all.

19:48.291 --> 19:49.958
What's wrong? Are you sick?

19:50.041 --> 19:50.875
No…

19:51.666 --> 19:53.250
I'm actually doing great.

19:54.416 --> 19:55.833
Great. Let's go.

19:55.916 --> 19:56.750
Yeah.

19:57.541 --> 19:58.750
This can't be real.

19:59.291 --> 20:00.958
I'm alone with Asamiya.

20:05.958 --> 20:07.625
Call me when you're ready.

20:07.708 --> 20:08.958
Thank you.

20:11.458 --> 20:13.583
I've been wanting to come here.

20:13.666 --> 20:14.583
Okay.

20:15.083 --> 20:17.458
I come to cafés like this a lot too.

20:17.541 --> 20:18.416
Really?

20:18.958 --> 20:20.166
That's great.

20:21.625 --> 20:23.625
Thanks for the other day.

20:24.125 --> 20:27.500
This is my first part-time job,
and I didn't know what to do.

20:28.000 --> 20:30.541
I was grateful when you intervened.

20:31.125 --> 20:32.416
This is my thank you.

20:32.500 --> 20:35.166
You really didn't have to.

20:35.958 --> 20:39.875
They got carried away.
I'll let them know next time I see them.

20:41.250 --> 20:42.291
Shall we order?

20:42.375 --> 20:45.375
Yeah, let's see what they have.

20:46.041 --> 20:49.750
What the hell?
800 yen for a cup of coffee?

20:50.333 --> 20:52.208
I'll get the strawberry parfait.

20:52.291 --> 20:55.500
It's 1,800 yen for strawberries,
ice cream and whipped cream?

20:55.583 --> 20:59.125
Why does it cost so much?
That's my food budget for a week.

20:59.708 --> 21:01.666
We're ready to order.

21:01.750 --> 21:02.583
-Sure.
-Okay.

21:04.125 --> 21:05.791
-I'll have a hot coffee.
-Okay.

21:05.875 --> 21:08.125
There goes three days worth of food.

21:08.750 --> 21:11.333
Great, I've got the best angle.

21:11.833 --> 21:13.750
You're invading their privacy.

21:13.833 --> 21:16.125
We'll lose views if we only stream fights.

21:18.291 --> 21:20.958
Viral Hit, starting livestream now.

21:22.791 --> 21:24.166
SHIMURA'S ON A DATE LOL

21:24.250 --> 21:25.791
YOU GOT THIS, WALLFLOWER!

21:40.291 --> 21:41.958
Let's eat.

21:45.041 --> 21:49.291
So what made you want to work
at that burger joint?

21:49.375 --> 21:50.625
What do you mean?

21:50.708 --> 21:54.750
I mean, you come across
as a well-off girl.

21:54.833 --> 21:58.583
Not at all. We're just a normal family.

21:58.666 --> 21:59.916
I see.

22:01.166 --> 22:04.041
Crap. The conversation ended.

22:05.000 --> 22:06.500
Why's a hottie like her…

22:06.583 --> 22:08.791
-Maybe she's scamming him.
-True.

22:12.625 --> 22:14.916
Doesn't this feel like
we're on a double date?

22:15.958 --> 22:18.166
-Want a bite, Aki?
-I don't like chicken.

22:18.250 --> 22:19.708
But it's so good.

22:19.791 --> 22:22.166
I also don't like
watching people eat chicken.

22:24.541 --> 22:27.708
That dude's outfit is so lame.

22:28.250 --> 22:30.250
Hey, they can hear us.

22:31.375 --> 22:33.916
I heard every word you've been saying.

22:34.416 --> 22:36.041
You're not wrong.

22:36.791 --> 22:39.000
Why would someone like her…

22:41.500 --> 22:42.500
Aki?

22:44.541 --> 22:46.416
Hot! What the hell?

22:46.500 --> 22:48.791
You hate chicken that much?

22:52.416 --> 22:53.416
Aki, I'm sorry.

22:53.916 --> 22:56.541
I didn't realize
you hated chicken that much.

22:56.625 --> 22:57.666
I'm going home.

22:58.291 --> 22:59.666
This is unpleasant.

23:15.625 --> 23:18.000
I'm sorry about today.

23:18.583 --> 23:20.375
I shouldn't have dragged you here.

23:22.333 --> 23:23.875
The tab's on me.

23:26.708 --> 23:28.041
You've got it wrong.

23:29.541 --> 23:30.791
I keep thinking

23:31.291 --> 23:35.541
you might be embarrassed
to be seen with me.

23:37.458 --> 23:38.458
Besides,

23:39.458 --> 23:43.833
I've never hung out with a girl alone.

23:44.416 --> 23:48.416
And I've actually never been
to a fancy café like this, either.

23:52.250 --> 23:55.750
I don't know what to talk about

23:56.750 --> 23:58.041
or how to carry myself.

23:58.541 --> 23:59.458
So…

24:01.708 --> 24:02.625
I'm so sorry.

24:05.958 --> 24:07.083
Let's go outside.

24:10.541 --> 24:13.375
It's a nice day. Let's talk some more.

24:16.666 --> 24:17.708
Sure.

24:20.791 --> 24:23.625
Oh, really? Okay.

24:24.625 --> 24:28.666
Sorry. That was a call
from one of my grade school friends.

24:29.458 --> 24:31.708
Wait. You go to the same high school.

24:31.791 --> 24:32.958
Who's your friend?

24:33.041 --> 24:34.625
Do you know Tatsuya Ogi?

24:35.583 --> 24:37.000
Isn't Ogi…

24:37.916 --> 24:38.750
that guy?

24:41.250 --> 24:43.791
Of course, I know him.

24:43.875 --> 24:46.750
We're like… besties.

24:46.833 --> 24:48.208
-Really?
-Yeah.

24:48.291 --> 24:50.291
He says he's nearby.

24:50.375 --> 24:51.916
Oh, really?

24:52.000 --> 24:54.416
You won't mind if he comes by, will you?

24:54.916 --> 24:56.708
Maybe not today.

24:57.791 --> 24:58.791
Kaho.

24:58.875 --> 24:59.708
Tatsuya!

25:00.208 --> 25:02.125
You really were close by.

25:03.208 --> 25:04.750
This is Shimura.

25:05.250 --> 25:06.791
I heard you two are close.

25:07.291 --> 25:10.208
Close? As in, friends?

25:17.666 --> 25:18.791
I guess we are.

25:19.666 --> 25:20.791
He goes to my school.

25:22.250 --> 25:24.583
You started livestreaming, right?

25:24.666 --> 25:25.708
Really?

25:27.125 --> 25:28.500
Just a bit.

25:28.583 --> 25:31.000
I watch your channel, Viral Hit.

25:31.583 --> 25:33.333
Oh, thanks.

25:33.416 --> 25:34.250
You're…

25:34.750 --> 25:36.083
quite a good fighter.

25:37.666 --> 25:42.041
You took the hit before his arm
was fully extended to minimize damage.

25:44.541 --> 25:46.791
You knew it wouldn't hurt.

25:47.708 --> 25:48.666
Ogi.

25:49.333 --> 25:52.666
He might know something
about that rooster guy.

25:56.000 --> 25:59.375
Let's go for a walk.
There's a nice spot over there.

26:08.541 --> 26:11.875
Enter the rival!
It's starting to get interesting!

26:11.958 --> 26:14.750
Stay tuned,
and don't miss what happens next!

26:14.833 --> 26:16.583
Don't run, Kaho!

26:19.125 --> 26:20.166
Remember that?

26:20.250 --> 26:21.333
Course I do.

26:21.958 --> 26:23.875
-We took the ferry.
-Yup.

26:24.458 --> 26:26.500
I hope we can still ride it now.

26:26.583 --> 26:27.750
I bet we can.

26:27.833 --> 26:28.791
I wanna ride it.

26:36.208 --> 26:37.625
Is your gym close by?

26:37.708 --> 26:39.083
Just over there.

26:39.166 --> 26:40.791
I didn't know that.

26:41.333 --> 26:42.166
Question.

26:42.666 --> 26:46.125
Choose the two
that look best together out of the three.

26:46.625 --> 26:48.875
Even grade-schoolers
could figure out the answer.

26:49.375 --> 26:51.583
And I know the answer too.

26:52.625 --> 26:54.291
The answer is simple.

26:55.250 --> 26:56.541
The third wheel

26:57.250 --> 26:58.250
is me.

27:01.333 --> 27:02.208
Sorry guys.

27:04.666 --> 27:06.541
I'm sorry, but…

27:08.291 --> 27:10.583
I'm heading home
cause my ingrown toenail hurts.

27:11.250 --> 27:12.208
Ingrown toenail?

27:12.291 --> 27:14.666
Yeah, my ingrown toenail.

27:15.625 --> 27:16.625
See you.

27:17.583 --> 27:19.083
Shimura?

27:19.166 --> 27:22.708
If I stay any longer,
I might die from self-loathing.

27:25.250 --> 27:26.166
Is he okay?

27:26.750 --> 27:27.708
He'll be fine.

27:35.041 --> 27:37.166
I know you're following me!

27:37.250 --> 27:38.541
You knew?

27:38.625 --> 27:39.666
Dead giveaway.

27:39.750 --> 27:41.041
When did you catch on?

27:41.125 --> 27:42.708
When you entered the café.

27:43.208 --> 27:44.208
Seriously?

27:45.291 --> 27:46.791
You're not, by any chance

27:48.041 --> 27:49.250
livestreaming, are you?

27:49.333 --> 27:53.166
Of course not.
That would be an invasion of your privacy.

27:55.833 --> 27:56.916
Give it back!

27:57.000 --> 27:57.958
BUSTED LOL

27:58.041 --> 27:59.125
HILARIOUS

28:00.125 --> 28:01.791
Why the hell would you do that?

28:01.875 --> 28:04.208
I thought we'd shake things up.

28:04.291 --> 28:05.500
This is the worst.

28:06.416 --> 28:07.541
You're right.

28:07.625 --> 28:09.125
You really are the worst.

28:09.208 --> 28:11.250
An ingrown toenail? You're so lame.

28:11.750 --> 28:13.125
It just kinda came out.

28:13.208 --> 28:16.500
I'm saying you're lame
for fleeing like a coward!

28:16.583 --> 28:19.041
What was I supposed to do?

28:22.708 --> 28:25.708
Love is like a competition, okay?

28:26.291 --> 28:27.125
What?

28:27.208 --> 28:30.291
It's a match to win
the heart of the one you love.

28:31.041 --> 28:34.166
You're giving up
just because a powerhouse shows up?

28:35.750 --> 28:38.541
Yeah. If I don't fight, I won't lose.

28:39.708 --> 28:41.833
You coward. Loser!

28:41.916 --> 28:43.583
Listen closely!

28:44.333 --> 28:47.750
A world-famous basketball coach once said,

28:48.250 --> 28:51.166
"If you give up, the game will be over."

28:52.791 --> 28:56.041
Are you seriously giving up now?

28:56.541 --> 28:59.250
You got back up
when Hamaken knocked you down.

28:59.333 --> 29:02.416
You faced that thug
so you didn't lose her contact info.

29:02.500 --> 29:05.708
The final buzzer hasn't gone off yet!

29:05.791 --> 29:08.333
Go! Get her back!

29:10.500 --> 29:11.666
Kanegon.

29:13.083 --> 29:14.041
You…

29:18.291 --> 29:21.500
Thanks.
You helped me get my head straight.

29:21.583 --> 29:23.875
Of course. We're friends, after all.

29:26.916 --> 29:28.166
I'm gonna get her back.

29:30.041 --> 29:34.500
That's right.
That's what a true streamer would do.

29:35.250 --> 29:37.000
Now, please continue to enjoy

29:37.083 --> 29:40.791
"Confessing love to a girl
who's completely out of my league."

29:47.750 --> 29:49.208
Asamiya!

29:55.625 --> 29:58.291
I wanted to talk to you about something.

29:58.375 --> 29:59.541
Something?

30:00.833 --> 30:01.958
Where'd Ogi go?

30:02.041 --> 30:04.333
He left for practice at the gym.

30:04.416 --> 30:06.291
Oh, I see.

30:07.166 --> 30:09.416
How's your ingrown toenail?

30:09.500 --> 30:11.208
It's all better now.

30:11.708 --> 30:14.416
I see. So what did you want to talk about?

30:14.500 --> 30:17.791
Right, I wanted to talk…

30:17.875 --> 30:20.958
What's your type?

30:22.250 --> 30:23.583
That was out of the blue.

30:23.666 --> 30:27.166
Sorry, I just really wanted to ask you.

30:29.208 --> 30:30.541
Someone who's strong.

30:31.125 --> 30:33.875
-Someone strong?
-What about you, Shimura?

30:33.958 --> 30:34.958
Huh? Me?

30:35.458 --> 30:38.083
Mine is…

30:38.791 --> 30:41.583
Someone like you, Asamiya.

30:42.083 --> 30:44.000
No way could I actually say that.

30:47.625 --> 30:49.625
I knew you were filming.

30:49.708 --> 30:51.166
Knock it off.

30:51.916 --> 30:54.291
Kanegon, what happened to your face?

30:54.958 --> 30:56.000
Run…

30:59.250 --> 31:01.083
Thanks, Kanegon.

31:01.625 --> 31:04.958
Your broadcast saved me
the trouble of finding you.

31:05.666 --> 31:06.916
Great job.

31:07.416 --> 31:10.166
Didn't I say I'll make you pay?

31:10.250 --> 31:11.916
What is wrong with you?

31:12.000 --> 31:13.333
-I'm calling--
-Asamiya.

31:14.250 --> 31:15.541
Go home.

31:15.625 --> 31:16.541
What?

31:17.458 --> 31:18.416
Go?

31:19.125 --> 31:21.583
-Get up.
-She's not going anywhere.

31:22.083 --> 31:23.458
Let go of me!

31:24.125 --> 31:25.333
Hey, you!

31:25.416 --> 31:26.333
Asamiya!

31:26.416 --> 31:27.416
Let go of me!

31:28.125 --> 31:32.125
You acted like you weren't into men
when I asked for your number.

31:32.208 --> 31:34.208
You little bitch.

31:34.791 --> 31:35.708
Stop it!

31:35.791 --> 31:36.833
Stay levelheaded.

31:37.333 --> 31:39.583
I can't lose my cool before him.

31:39.666 --> 31:43.416
There's no opponent easier to defeat
than one who's lost his cool.

31:43.500 --> 31:45.583
I have to restrain myself.

31:46.416 --> 31:47.916
-I said stop!
-Hamaken.

31:51.625 --> 31:53.458
You only pick on women?

31:53.541 --> 31:55.666
Get him worked up.

31:56.458 --> 31:57.666
Outta my way.

31:58.375 --> 31:59.333
Shimura?

32:00.708 --> 32:02.083
Bastard.

32:02.833 --> 32:04.708
You've got some nerve!

32:04.791 --> 32:06.875
I can use that move.

32:16.833 --> 32:19.958
Dumbass.
You thought I wouldn't watch your videos?

32:20.041 --> 32:22.083
I mean, you upload everything.

32:22.166 --> 32:24.416
Ouch. This hurts real bad.

32:24.500 --> 32:25.541
Shimura!

32:27.250 --> 32:31.500
What do I do? What should I do now?

32:32.041 --> 32:35.333
My mind's gone blank.

32:43.041 --> 32:46.250
My house sits in the shadows,

32:46.750 --> 32:49.583
far below the towering skyscrapers.

32:49.666 --> 32:52.208
Argentine Backbreaker!

32:55.583 --> 32:57.125
Maybe that's the reason

32:58.625 --> 33:03.250
I've spent my life in the shadows.

33:04.875 --> 33:08.625
But then, this once-in-a-lifetime
opportunity came to me.

33:11.000 --> 33:15.750
I thought I could finally be an ordinary
high school student like everybody else.

33:16.541 --> 33:19.750
But I was a fool to dream.

33:22.916 --> 33:26.458
And now I'm paying the price.

33:28.208 --> 33:29.916
And now, I'm back to being

33:31.500 --> 33:33.125
a loser again.

33:33.875 --> 33:35.083
Shimura!

33:40.625 --> 33:42.666
-I'm home.
-You're home early.

33:42.750 --> 33:44.500
Weren't you meeting friends?

33:45.500 --> 33:46.708
Bad taste.

33:46.791 --> 33:47.750
Huh?

33:52.750 --> 33:53.875
THE STREAM HAS ENDED

33:53.958 --> 33:55.583
Good. He ended it.

33:57.791 --> 34:02.250
WATCH WHAT HAPPENS NEXT ON HAMAKEN TV

34:08.166 --> 34:11.000
Shimura! Stop this, please.

34:11.083 --> 34:13.000
I always thought

34:13.083 --> 34:16.958
it was better to get hit
than to fight back.

34:17.458 --> 34:18.500
Hey!

34:19.208 --> 34:20.666
It's not over yet.

34:23.000 --> 34:24.666
Let her go.

34:24.750 --> 34:25.583
What?

34:28.000 --> 34:29.583
Please, I'm begging you.

34:33.541 --> 34:36.666
Let Asamiya go home.

34:37.500 --> 34:39.333
Let go of me. Shimura!

34:39.416 --> 34:43.875
I don't want her to see
how pathetic I am any longer.

34:44.458 --> 34:46.583
You trying to show off?

34:47.875 --> 34:49.791
You're nothing but a loser, Shimura!

34:50.375 --> 34:51.500
Shimura!

34:51.583 --> 34:55.125
Asamiya was the one person
I didn't want to realize

34:56.166 --> 34:59.458
just how weak and pathetic I really am.

35:14.000 --> 35:15.375
I apologize.

35:17.250 --> 35:18.166
Shimura.

35:20.875 --> 35:21.708
That won't do.

35:22.708 --> 35:24.208
Apologize in your underwear…

35:25.958 --> 35:27.583
to my viewers.

35:28.916 --> 35:29.750
Film him.

35:31.500 --> 35:36.208
Guess how many viewers are tuned in
to my channel now.

35:37.458 --> 35:39.625
Shimura, I'm so sorry.

35:40.125 --> 35:42.916
I told him I didn't want to do this.

35:46.541 --> 35:47.791
NO NEED TO APOLOGIZE

35:47.875 --> 35:48.916
SHIMURA!

35:49.000 --> 35:50.041
PLEASE STOP

35:51.208 --> 35:53.000
You've got the perfect angle.

35:53.083 --> 35:55.250
Seriously, he's so lame.

35:56.625 --> 35:57.458
Hey.

35:58.125 --> 36:01.916
You're good with that camera,
I'll give you that.

36:05.666 --> 36:07.875
Start stripping already.

36:08.458 --> 36:10.083
If you do, I'll let her go.

36:10.166 --> 36:11.833
Take your clothes off.

36:11.916 --> 36:12.958
Do it already.

36:17.666 --> 36:18.750
Hey!

36:21.333 --> 36:22.333
Enough already!

36:24.416 --> 36:25.833
The girl I'm in love with

36:26.541 --> 36:28.916
showed more courage than me.

36:29.000 --> 36:29.916
Let go of me!

36:30.625 --> 36:32.666
I've never felt so worthless.

36:34.375 --> 36:35.208
Hamaken!

36:35.291 --> 36:36.208
What?

36:45.500 --> 36:47.458
I've failed as a man.

36:48.250 --> 36:49.708
I took my clothes off like you asked.

36:51.500 --> 36:52.541
Now let her go.

36:54.125 --> 36:56.916
-No way!
-He actually stripped!

36:57.583 --> 36:59.000
What a loser.

36:59.708 --> 37:01.250
Kanegon, film this!

37:01.333 --> 37:02.458
Keep rolling!

37:04.375 --> 37:05.833
This is fine.

37:06.375 --> 37:08.833
I'm not confident I can win the fight.

37:10.041 --> 37:13.208
This is the only way
I can protect Asamiya.

37:16.333 --> 37:17.250
But

37:18.208 --> 37:19.875
I must try to retaliate.

37:21.291 --> 37:22.583
This is my…

37:24.583 --> 37:25.625
Shimura?

37:25.708 --> 37:28.000
Hey. Stop it.

37:29.291 --> 37:31.125
This is my last stand.

37:31.208 --> 37:32.250
We'll get banned.

37:38.125 --> 37:39.625
Stop!

37:39.708 --> 37:42.000
Goodbye, Asamiya.

37:55.916 --> 38:02.250
VIRAL HIT

39:20.541 --> 39:23.708
Subtitle translation by:
Kanako Connie Takahashi
